@title Two closed-loop winches: the first motor's property sheet shows the Two winches on one beam section
@area Simulate
@sizes 1920x1080
# Lane L2c, pair. Selecting the first winch's motor shows its "Closed-loop winch" rows and, below them,
# "Two winches on one beam": the second winch, the beam, the ropes and the synchronisation.
open qa/fixtures/closed-winch-pair.novo
wait 30
key Escape
wait 5
key Home
wait 30
click 938 719
wait 30
shot motor-selected
expect "Hook load (payload and block)"
scroll 1685 500 -1500
wait 20
expect "Second winch on the same beam"
shot beam-and-sync-rows
check_layout
